+## Failure, idempotency, concurrency, offline
+| Scenario | Behavior |
+|---|---|
+| Server commits, response lost | Client retries with same key, receives original offer. |
+| Commit fails | Nothing stored (atomic per aggregate). Client retries with same key. |
